1
00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:04,350
It took Akhil three years to save ₹2 lakh.

2
00:00:04,370 --> 00:00:08,127
It took the market just 11 days to take it.

3
00:00:08,743 --> 00:00:10,695
A ₹30,000 salary.

4
00:00:10,715 --> 00:00:14,017
Rent, food, money sent home…

5
00:00:14,037 --> 00:00:17,910
Still, every month he saved ₹5,500.

6
00:00:17,930 --> 00:00:19,067
No trips.

7
00:00:19,087 --> 00:00:20,373
No new phone.

8
00:00:20,393 --> 00:00:21,311
Three years.

9
00:00:21,331 --> 00:00:24,782
Then one night, a friend's message:

10
00:00:24,802 --> 00:00:27,758
“Bro, made ₹40,000 in options today.”

11
00:00:27,778 --> 00:00:29,052
“Easy money.”

12
00:00:29,072 --> 00:00:32,210
Akhil didn't even know what a strike price was.

13
00:00:32,230 --> 00:00:34,849
He pressed BUY on a call option.

14
00:00:34,869 --> 00:00:37,745
By noon: ₹30,000 profit.

15
00:00:37,765 --> 00:00:39,088
In one day.

16
00:00:39,108 --> 00:00:40,480
A whole month's salary.

17
00:00:42,023 --> 00:00:43,440
The next day, the same.

18
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:44,895
₹18,000 more.

19
00:00:44,915 --> 00:00:46,977
Now he's doing the math:

20
00:00:46,997 --> 00:00:48,876
“If I make this every day…

21
00:00:48,896 --> 00:00:50,662
why even go to work?”

22
00:00:52,339 --> 00:00:53,983
Then the market turned.

23
00:00:54,003 --> 00:00:56,378
He bought more to win back the loss.

24
00:00:56,398 --> 00:00:57,703
Then even more.

25
00:00:57,723 --> 00:01:01,881
11 days later, three years of savings were gone.

26
00:01:01,901 --> 00:01:03,737
Not a single rupee left.

27
00:01:05,407 --> 00:01:06,956
He started again.

28
00:01:06,976 --> 00:01:08,919
Saved ₹50,000 more.

29
00:01:08,939 --> 00:01:11,945
Chasing the lost money, he lost that too.

30
00:01:13,244 --> 00:01:15,450
That night, he finally understood:

31
00:01:15,470 --> 00:01:17,662
he wasn't trading.

32
00:01:17,682 --> 00:01:20,088
He was gambling with his own life.

33
00:01:20,108 --> 00:01:21,956
So he started again —

34
00:01:21,976 --> 00:01:23,656
the boring way.

35
00:01:23,676 --> 00:01:26,164
A Nifty ETF every month.

36
00:01:26,184 --> 00:01:28,536
A few good, solid companies.

37
00:01:28,556 --> 00:01:30,489
No tips. No calls.

38
00:01:31,102 --> 00:01:34,032
Today, Akhil isn't trying to get rich.

39
00:01:34,052 --> 00:01:37,748
He's just trying to get back to where he started.

40
00:01:37,768 --> 00:01:41,200
Don't learn this lesson the way Akhil did.

